{
  "_readme": [
    "Feed registry for the watcher and the generator.",
    "",
    "verified is set only by scripts/check-feeds.mjs against a live response.",
    "The generator and poller refuse any feed not marked verified, so an incorrect",
    "URL cannot reach a published citation.",
    "",
    "Each feed carries a jurisdiction. A piece is written into that country's",
    "folder. Feeds tagged skip are never used: the cross-country section requires",
    "comparing two or more countries, which a piece grounded in one item cannot do.",
    "",
    "Only 404 and 410 mean dead. A 403 is a bot wall and a 5xx is a bad day."
